"execution_count":30}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# Using predictions from model B"],"metadata":{"id":"4oGeETelB6GW"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Churned clients differ from At-risk clients in their meaning, though the difference is not as crucial to the business as with Active VS Non-active clients.Churn logic can be implemented  as follows:\n","\n","The model will give out a probability of client to be churned (the highest risk to business since client shows no interaction for a long time). Mixing client's probability to be churned and client's normed LTV the offer-score coefficient is produced. The more client is considered to be churned and the more valuable it is, the more business can spend to keep them. The formulas coefficients can be adjusted as one wants."],"metadata":{"id":"FuzPIrcWCAW8"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["probs = y_pred_B_proba[:, 1]\n","probs_churn = probs[y_val_B == 1]\n","probs_non_churn = probs[y_val_B == 0]\n","quantiles_churn = pd.Series(probs_churn).quantile([0.05, 0.10, 0.25, 0.50, 0.75, 0.90, 0.95, 0.99])\n","print(\"Quantiles for TRUE churn clients:\")\n","print(quantiles_churn)\n","\n","quantiles_non_churn = pd.Series(probs_non_churn).quantile([0.50, 0.75, 0.90, 0.95, 0.99])\n","print(\"Quantiles for NON-churn clients:\")\n","print(quantiles_non_churn)\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"jYIOXv5q61lV","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786135916066,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":41,"user":{"displayName":"соня костенко","userId":"08101190354278409981"}},"outputId":"d1279dbd-efd9-4c27-d0f3-3ac5ca893085"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Quantiles for TRUE churn clients:\n","0.05    0.199308\n","0.10    0.208559\n","0.25    0.364400\n","0.50    0.594429\n","0.75    0.651424\n","0.90    0.742991\n","0.95    0.753345\n","0.99    0.768065\n","dtype: float64\n","Quantiles for NON-churn clients:\n","0.50    0.149115\n","0.75    0.310316\n","0.90    0.580100\n","0.95    0.694719\n","0.99    0.759558\n","dtype: float64\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["kf = StratifiedKFold(n_splits=5, shuffle=True, random_state=42)\n","\n","probs = cross_val_predict(\n","    XGBClassifier(**final_params_B),\n","    X_full_B, y_full_B,\n","    cv=kf,\n","    method=\"predict_proba\"\n",")[:, 1]\n","\n","probs_churn = probs[y_full_B == 1]\n","quantiles_churn = pd.Series(probs_churn).quantile([0.05, 0.10, 0.25, 0.50, 0.75, 0.90, 0.95, 0.99])\n","\n","print(\"Quantiles for TRUE churn:\")\n","print(quantiles_churn)\n","\n","probs_non = probs[y_full_B == 0]\n","quantiles_non = pd.Series(probs_non).quantile([0.50,0.75,0.90,0.95,0.99])\n","print(\"Quantiles for NON-churn:\")\n","print(quantiles_non)"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"bJV2n6bCGQk4","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786137991099,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":4124,"user":{"displayName":"соня костенко","userId":"08101190354278409981"}},"outputId":"519f6543-6a9d-4b4f-f9d4-deacdb39f632"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Quantiles for TRUE churn:\n","0.05    0.167761\n","0.10    0.253544\n","0.25    0.380725\n","0.50    0.585775\n","0.75    0.697706\n","0.90    0.738223\n","0.95    0.756319\n","0.99    0.767555\n","dtype: float64\n","Quantiles for NON-churn:\n","0.50    0.152203\n","0.75    0.319775\n","0.90    0.578951\n","0.95    0.683853\n","0.99    0.757081\n","dtype: float64\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["train_set_non_active = train_set[train_set['target'] != 'ACTIVE']"],"metadata":{"id":"-6kzfHcKJC87"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["train_set_non_active[\"ltv_score\"] = (\n","    (train_set_non_active[\"succ_orders_count\"]*train_set_non_active[\"avg_order_value\"]) +\n","    (train_set_non_active[\"succ_orders_count_90d\"]*train_set_non_active[\"avg_order_value_90d\"])\n",")\n","\n","quantiles = train_set_non_active[\"ltv_score\"].quantile([0, 0.25, 0.5, 0.75, 0.95, 0.99])\n","print(\"LTV-score quantiles:\")\n","print(quantiles)\n","\n","q25 = quantiles.loc[0.25]\n","print(\"\\n25th percentile (q25):\", q25)\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"59B3fcT0JN1L","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786308749584,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":16,"user":{"displayName":"соня костенко","userId":"08101190354278409981"}},"outputId":"cff578b7-30c8-4d0a-f100-75c063bca938"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["LTV-score quantiles:\n","0.00        0.000000\n","0.25     4015.770000\n","0.50    11525.749998\n","0.75    23070.520000\n","0.95    48422.503998\n","0.99    76176.967587\n","Name: ltv_score, dtype: float64\n","\n","25th percentile (q25): 4015.77\n"]},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stderr","text":["/tmp/ipykernel_2590/3427106702.py:5: SettingWithCopyWarning: \n","A value is trying to be set on a copy of a slice from a DataFrame.\n","Try using .loc[row_indexer,col_indexer] = value instead\n","\n","See the caveats in the documentation: https://pandas.pydata.org/pandas-docs/stable/user_guide/indexing.html#returning-a-view-versus-a-copy\n","  train_set_non_active[\"ltv_score\"] = (\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Normalization parameters for offer score formula"],"metadata":{"id":"Mm2GGgXKFxp8"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["ltv_min = train_set_non_active[\"ltv_score\"].min()\n","ltv_q99 = train_set_non_active[\"ltv_score\"].quantile(0.99)\n","\n","\n","norm_params = {\n","    \"ltv_min\": ltv_min,\n","    \"ltv_q99\": ltv_q99,\n","    'p_churn_cap': 0.77,\n","    \"ltv_q25\": q25\n","\n","}\n","\n","joblib.dump(norm_params, \"/content/drive/MyDrive/normalization_params.joblib\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"1UBQfVT4EO3N","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786308771275,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":538,"user":{"displayName":"соня костенко","userId":"08101190354278409981"}},"outputId":"e60a53bb-b774-45db-b42b-174ffd835832"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"execute_result","data":{"text/plain":["['/content/drive/MyDrive/normalization_params.joblib']"]},"metadata":{},"execution_count":31}]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["norm_params = joblib.load(\"/content/drive/MyDrive/normalization_params.joblib\")"],"metadata":{"id":"tMCQfBxjgEMq","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786372424917,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":40,"user":{"displayName":"соня костенко","userId":"08101190354278409981"}}},"execution_count":12,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["ltv_min = norm_params[\"ltv_min\"]\n","ltv_q99 = norm_params[\"ltv_q99\"]\n","p_churn_cap = norm_params[\"p_churn_cap\"]\n","ltv_q25 = norm_params[\"ltv_q25\"]"],"metadata":{"id":"OhHWMw5C7s1H","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786372425873,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":29,"user":{"displayName":"соня костенко","userId":"08101190354278409981"}}},"execution_count":13,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["def norm_ltv(ltv, ltv_min=ltv_min, ltv_max=ltv_q99):\n","  norm_ltv = (ltv - ltv_min) / (ltv_max - ltv_min)\n","  return norm_ltv\n","\n","def p_churn_clip(p_churn, p_churn_cap=p_churn_cap):\n","    p_norm = p_churn / p_churn_cap\n","    return np.clip(p_norm, 0, 1)"],"metadata":{"id":"licrTHf0ZOMY","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786372428501,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":40,"user":{"displayName":"соня костенко","userId":"08101190354278409981"}}},"execution_count":14,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# Offer-score formula"],"metadata":{"id":"KidCxJF0Vhwu"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["The offer score formula is a coeeficient which can be multiplied by any business discount (e.g. default discount is 25%, multiplying 25 by offer score we can adjust the size of sale depending on client's churn probability and LTV).\n","\n","The offer score is 1 by default even if client has 0 normed LTV score, and 0 probability to be churned. The reason for that is because even if not churned, clients are still at risk group so business has to give them at least the smallest offer to not lose a client.\n","\n","The more client is at risk and the more valuable it is, the higher the offer.\n","\n","NOTE: churn probabilities will always be capped to 1, LTV normed is more flexible, meaning if there is a client with enormously high LTV, we might want to give them an extra offer. The lowest LTV score is 0 in our dataset, so the sign of LTV normed is always positive.  LTV is the only parameter in the formula that can make offer score even larger that 2, combined with churned probability >= 0.77 (the highest probability for actual churns in dataset).\n","\n","The formula parameters such as churn and LTV coefficients can be adjusted as wanted, but i chose 0.6 for churn and 0.4 for LTV as basic parameters which look reasonable."],"metadata":{"id":"bLV3bXZZVlub"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["def offer_score(p_churn_clip, ltv_norm, churn_coef=0.6, ltv_coef=0.4):\n","    offer_score = (churn_coef*p_churn_clip) + (ltv_coef*ltv_norm) + 1\n","    return offer_score"],"metadata":{"id":"YLr8MmprVKDx","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786372431920,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":16,"user":{"displayName":"соня костенко","userId":"08101190354278409981"}}},"execution_count":15,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["NOTE: learning curve for model B is considered to be ineffective due small amount of train data accompinied by less importance of model compared to model\n","a"],"metadata":{"id":"wQXSUUrMPUSz"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# Final models' training"],"metadata":{"id":"VA1l5qRHQNHz"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["model_A_final, model_B_final = train_pipeline(X_train, y_train)"],"metadata":{"id":"U4mSf7MXQxlE","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786364405086,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":4900,"user":{"displayName":"соня костенко","userId":"08101190354278409981"}}},"execution_count":45,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["joblib.dump(model_A_final, \"/content/drive/MyDrive/model_A.joblib\")\n","joblib.dump(model_B_final, \"/content/drive/MyDrive/model_B.joblib\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"Pl8x5CB_na4v","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786364422880,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":156,"user":{"displayName":"соня костенко","userId":"08101190354278409981"}},"outputId":"a34a2a0c-f054-42bd-d8dc-447149655619"},"execution_count":46,"outputs":[{"output_type":"execute_result","data":{"text/plain":["['/content/drive/MyDrive/model_B.joblib']"]},"metadata":{},"execution_count":46}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# Test evaluation"],"metadata":{"id":"jjCVTw1_RR-q"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["X_test_shap = select_features(X_test)\n","X_test_shap = basic_cleaning(X_test_shap)\n","X_test_shap = feature_engineering(X_test_shap)\n","joblib.dump(X_test_shap, \"/content/drive/MyDrive/X_test_shap.joblib\")\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"onM-e6yxeggG","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786367486238,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":169,"user":{"displayName":"соня костенко","userId":"08101190354278409981"}},"outputId":"5f247d57-836d-4043-bf15-9893931e43d4"},"execution_count":72,"outputs":[{"output_type":"execute_result","data":{"text/plain":["['/content/drive/MyDrive/X_test_shap.joblib']"]},"metadata":{},"execution_count":72}]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["model_A_final = joblib.load(\"/content/drive/MyDrive/model_A.joblib\")\n","model_B_final = joblib.load(\"/content/drive/MyDrive/model_B.joblib\")"],"metadata":{"id":"Rf_HK2FlGRux","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786372539901,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":233,"user":{"displayName":"соня костенко","userId":"08101190354278409981"}}},"execution_count":18,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Due to the specifics of using Churned target, model's performance will be measured only on ACTIVE vs NON-ACTIVE predictions from model A.\n","\n","**NORMAL CONFUSION MATRIX:**\n","\n","Clients are considered NON-ACTIVE is their probability is greater or equal to 0.35\n","\n","**CONFUSION MATRIX WITH ADDITIONAL LTV FILTRATION:**\n","\n","\n","Business logic filtration will be applied to the first confusion matrix, meaning a client will be considered ACTIVE if he is eaither ACTIVE or LOW-RISK LOW-VALUE. This will show how applying such business logic and ignoring LOW-RISK LOW-VALUE clients will affect Precision and Recall and can help with choosing the right business strategy\n","\n"],"metadata":{"id":"AFyvKBJmRWef"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["out = prediction_pipeline(X_test, model_A_final, model_B_final)"],"metadata":{"id":"9yjVnqf0Ss5w","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786372589910,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":359,"user":{"displayName":"соня костенко","userId":"08101190354278409981"}}},"execution_count":22,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["out.head(5)"],"metadata":{"id":"TzYgOQ4aTRU-","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":206},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786372593127,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":62,"user":{"displayName":"соня костенко","userId":"08101190354278409981"}},"outputId":"3653435c-e4bf-48bc-c6ca-40ac8a29ffe6"},"execution_count":23,"outputs":[{"output_type":"execute_result","data":{"text/plain":["       customer_id     segment  offer_score  churn_prob  active_prob\n","24845        27327      ACTIVE     0.000000    0.000000     0.927471\n","71005        78124  NON-ACTIVE     1.318767    0.133565     0.595210\n","59953        65964  NON-ACTIVE     1.331342    0.298460     0.348083\n","48265        53116  NON-ACTIVE     1.144235    0.133199     0.345208\n","28223        31038  NON-ACTIVE     1.107343    0.137757     0.310658"],"text/html":["\n","  <div id=\"df-38128291-ab27-44dc-893a-ac6e14d8a6d7\" class=\"colab-df-container\">\n","    <div>\n","<style scoped>\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n","        verti